     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Correcting information",
     "texto": [
      "To correct a detail, first identify what is wrong, then give the correct form.",
      "**Rette** means «to correct»; **rette opp** means «to correct» or «to fix» something. Do not confuse **rett** («correct») with **rett** as a noun («right» or «dish»), depending on the context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
